{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112371","id":2974955469,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6xUjfN","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112371","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112371.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112371.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112371","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112371/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112371/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112371/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b30b11b01276ec270c4ea8ba767f06f671be8f97","number":112371,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add custom `StyleBox` to `TreeItem`","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Allows setting a custom `StyleBox` in `TreeItem` cells in a similar way you would set a custom BG color, text or icon:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n\r\nconst MY_STYLEBOX = preload(\"res://path/to/my_stylebox.tres\")\r\n\r\nfunc _ready():\r\nvar tree = Tree.new()\r\nvar root = tree.create_item()\r\nvar child = tree.create_item(root)\r\nchild.set_custom_stylebox(0, MY_STYLEBOX)\r\n```\r\n\r\nDraw order should be:\r\n1. Custom BG color\r\n2. Custom StyleBox\r\n3. The rest of the components (including StyleBoxes drawn through the custom draw callback)\r\n\r\nThis could have the potential to deprecate the custom BG color, but I'm leaving it as it is as they can coexist.\r\n\r\nWeird demonstration I made for testing, with 4 different `StyleBox`es (start, middle, end, full, and all cell types in each row):\r\n<img width=\"1120\" height=\"546\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7386028b-fedf-409b-9a41-c7a281639ed8\" />\r\n\r\nThis should allow implementing #112360 and reimplementing #112233 without having to do workarounds (not part of this PR):\r\n<img width=\"935\" height=\"554\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e302d055-09df-45ad-86ae-1770e96caa72\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"no